json/object
description: Comma-separated list of key-value pairs, enclosed into curly braces
- >
  An **object** is a collection of key-value pairs, enclosed into curly braces and separated by
  commas. The pairs are unordered, and keys within one object should be unique:
- !!<format: text/x-json> |
  {"name": "Julia", "age": 42}
- >
  The pair is a construct of its own — see the subchapter below:
- *: 00-json_key_value_pair
